"P2834207176" "You hear the sounds of Longbow operatives completing a raid on this facility. You might be just in time to spoil their day."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1996308174" "Today is great! It's not every day we capture an infamous criminal like Ghost Widow."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1235039611" "{VillainName} must be here to bust Ghost Widow out! "
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P419147242" "This will be a bitter pill for Arachnos to swallow."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P888730923" "Don't let {Hero.gender=Male him|her} past us!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P3287728236" "Make sure security is tight."
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P2742695521" "We can't let anyone rescue Ghost Widow."
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG1 :
"P3153552946" "<shout>Oh no, it's {VillainName}!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG2 :
"P1979957425" "<shout>Stop {Hero.gender=Male him|her} now, before {Hero.gender=Male he|she} reaches Ghost Widow!"
