// Script Variable HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2332237836" "My savior has arrived. My release is imminent."
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P193076435" "I can't believe we caught Ghost Widow!"
