// Objective - DestroyTablet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P892333502" "Destroy the Tabula"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P300935986" "The Tabula Scutum pulses with power one final time and then shatters."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P708118358" "You have defeated the guardians and destroyed the Tabula Scutum, releasing its energy for Sister Airlia to channel to Ghost Widow in the future. It's time to see about this 'generous' reward you were promised."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P150974105" "{VillainName}, you have aided me in my future endeavors. But you no doubt wish for your reward in the now, and so you shall have it.<br><br>My need for you now is done. But our strands on the Loom of Fate are yet intertwined, and we are destined to meet again."

